This project uses the public model, loader and LoRA APIs of ComfyUI and the
installed official OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image ComfyUI backend.

The MOSS block arithmetic adapter in runtime.py follows/adapts the mathematical
sequence in MOSS-Image's comfyui/moss-image/model.py (_Block.forward), licensed
by its upstream authors under Apache License 2.0. The original attention and
nonlinear functions are called from the installed upstream package. Upstream
copyrights remain with their respective authors; the Apache license is included
under licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

Generic compilation and LoRA management modules are adapted from the author's
ComfyUI-K2-Precompile project under GNU GPL v3, with MOSS-specific entry points.
The combined node source is distributed under GNU GPL v3; see LICENSE.

Model weights, ComfyUI, the official MOSS package and quantization backends are
not bundled. Their respective licenses remain applicable.
